{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","哈拉克"],["/names/en","Harak"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名食欲旺盛的战士，会在战斗中持续寻找目标进食。"],["/description_i18n/en","A ravenous Warrior who continuously hunts for targets to devour in battle."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","你怎么知道我饿了"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/en","How did you know I was hungry?"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","不错的餐后甜点"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/en","A nice dessert."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","进食时刻到了"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/en","It's feeding time!"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","不够，远远不够"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/en","Not enough. Never enough..."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","下一顿在哪"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/en","Where's my next meal?"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","你看起来很美味"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/en","You look absolutely delicious."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哈哈……啊……！刚才的进食……真令人愉快"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/text_i18n/en","Hahaha... AH...! The meal just now was sweet."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","来吧，让我打败你，或者吃掉你"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/text_i18n/en","Come on, let's fight so I can devour you."],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","让我……嗯？有血腥味？哼"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/text_i18n/en","I will... Hmm? Smells like blood. Yes..."],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","味道不错，多给我弄点。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","This is tasty. Get me more."],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","哼，勉强填填肚子吧。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","It barely fills the stomach."],["/affinity_gift_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","是想让我吃了你吗？"],["/affinity_gift_lines/2/text_i18n/en","Do you want me to devour you?"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","深海狂鲨"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/en","Deepsea Ravager"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","如果不是进食的欲望将他唤醒，他本可以永沉深海。"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/en","Only hunger can rouse him."],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","荆棘鲨鳍"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/en","Barbed Abyss"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","自深海而上，刺破海面、撕碎所有，吞噬一切。"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/en","It rises from the deep ocean, breaking the surface and devouring all."],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","金玫瑰高定商店兑换获得。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/en","Rosy Store"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","传说"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/en","Legendary"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哈哈哈哈哈，大吃特吃！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Haha, I'll eat to my heart's content!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","打扰，吃东西，不许！！！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","Eating! Do not disturb!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","快！快给我吃的！有什么上什么！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Give me something to eat! Anything!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","呼哈！雪！冲啊！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Snow? Is it edible?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","哈哈哈哈哈，大吃特吃！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/1/text_i18n/en","Haha, I'll eat to my heart's content!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","大餐？！在哪儿！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/en","A feast?! Where?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","有大餐！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/en","A feast!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我要吃个痛快！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Let's dig in!"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","哈拉克吃不饱的时候会非常生气，生气的时候，他的进食欲望就会更加迫切。这是一个死循环。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","When Harak's hunger strikes, it unleashes a ferocious rage that only feeds his need to devour, locking him in a relentless cycle."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","任何打断哈拉克进食的人和事，都会承受哈拉克食欲和怒气叠加的报复。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","Any soul foolish enough to disturb his meal will feel the crushing weight of his fury and his insatiable appetite combined."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","哈拉克曾尝试不同食物使用不同的吃法，但不到一天他就放弃了，他还是更喜欢简单直接的进食方式——大吃特吃。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","Harak once dabbled in new ways to enjoy his meals, but within a day, he gave up. He lives to consume, and nothing beats the raw satisfaction of devouring everything in his path."],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","过于旺盛的食欲有时会转化为战斗和破坏的欲望。把敌人全部吃掉就是哈拉克一贯以来战斗的方式。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","Sometimes, his boundless hunger bleeds into a need for battle. Swallowing his enemies whole has long been his favored way of conquest."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","吃的太多也有烦恼，普通的食物难以满足哈拉克挑剔的胃口，他开始转向吞噬生物的欲望，这会给他带来新的满足！"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","Harak's endless appetite has its downsides. Ordinary meals no longer sate his stomach; he's found that only living creatures offer the depth of satisfaction he craves."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","“一个被进食欲望吞噬的傻瓜而已”——一位哈拉克的旧识如此评价。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","\"A fool devoured by his own hunger,\" an old acquaintance once said of him."],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","哈拉克的舌头不仅可以分叉还长了倒刺，灵敏的舌头让他的狩猎很少失败。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","With a tongue both forked and barbed, Harak's hunting rarely fails, his prey snared by its razor edges."],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","哈拉克的武器是用其他无数猎物的骨头做的——当然，那些猎物最后都进了他的肚子。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","His weapon is crafted from the bones of his countless victims, each one a testament to his brutal appetite."],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","哈拉克向来忠于自我，他的自我也很简单——吃饱，吃好。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","Harak's motives are simple and unchanging: to feast and fill himself completely."],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","传说，哈拉克被封印之前，曾因为吃空了一片海域而被多方讨伐。某处的海岸边，至今能见到那时大战留下的痕迹。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","Legends say that before his sealing, Harak ravaged an entire sea, devouring its life until a coalition rose against him. Along certain coastal shores, traces of that devastating battle still remain."],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","……你闻起来不好吃。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","...You don't smell delicious at all."],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415044.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415044.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","哈拉克 & 霍德希金"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Harak & Hodgkin"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","哈哈哈哈哈，大吃特吃！"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","Haha, I'll eat to my heart's content!"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415337.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415337.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","哈拉克"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Harak"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","快！快给我吃的！有什么上什么！"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","Give me something to eat! Anything!"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415338.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415338.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","哈拉克"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Harak"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","呼哈！雪！冲啊！"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","Snow? Is it edible?"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415473.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415473.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","哈拉克"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Harak"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","大餐？！在哪儿！"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","A feast?! Where?"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415474.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415474.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","哈拉克"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/en","Harak"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","有大餐！"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/en","A feast!"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415653.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415653.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","哈拉克"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/en","Harak"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","我要吃个痛快！"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/en","Let's dig in!"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415654.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415654.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","哈拉克"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/en","Harak"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","这里，温度，适中，准备播种……"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/en","The temperature here... is mild... Seeding could be done..."],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415664.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415664.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","悉达 & 哈拉克"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/en","Saida & Harak"]]}